Package: samsung-ml2160-rust
Version: 1.0.2-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cups (>= 2.4), cups-filters
Maintainer: CUPS Raster Filter Developer <caganergun@tutanota.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/caganerg/samsung-ml2160-rust
Description: CUPS raster filter for Samsung ML-2160 series printers
 rastertospl-rust converts the CUPS raster stream (RaSt/RaS2/RaS3) into the
 native SPL2 / QPDL v3 format spoken by Samsung ML-2160, ML-2165, ML-2165W
 and ML-2168 monochrome laser printers: PJL job envelope, 17-byte page
 header, Algo 0x11 RLE-compressed band records and checksums.
 .
 The package ships the filter binary and the matching PPD. The filter is
 statically linked against musl, so it carries no libc dependency of its own
 and runs unchanged on Debian 13 (trixie) and later.
